<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>⚠️ 访问被拦截</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            background-color: #0d0d0d; 
            color: #ff3333; 
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 50px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .alert-box {
            border: 2px solid #ff3333;
            padding: 40px;
            max-width: 650px;
            background: rgba(30, 0, 0, 0.9);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 51, 51, 0.25);
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        /* 扫描线动画 */
        .alert-box::before {
            content: " ";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.06), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.02), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.06));
            background-size: 100% 2px, 3px 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 2.2em; border-bottom: 1px solid #ff3333; padding-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        p { font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.6; }
        code { background: #440000; padding: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid #880000; color: #ffcccc; font-weight: bold; }
        .highlight { color: #fff; font-weight: bold; }
        
        /* 新增：调试日志区域样式 */
        .debug-console {
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 700px;
            background: #000;
            border: 1px dashed #444;
            color: #555;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            margin-top: 20px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        .debug-title {
            color: #888;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            display: block;
        }
        .log-entry { margin: 2px 0; font-family: Consolas, monospace; }
        .log-success { color: #006600; }
        .log-warn { color: #ccaa00; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="alert-box">
        <h1>⚠️ 严重安全警报</h1>
        <p><strong>访问被强制终止：</strong>多因素认证 (MFA) 校验失败</p>
        <hr style="border-color: #660000; opacity: 0.5;">
        <p>虽然您的管理员密码验证通过，但系统未检测到受信任的物理令牌。</p>
        <p>请插入 <span class="highlight">YubiKey (FIPS)</span> 以继续会话。</p>
        <br>
        <p>错误代码: <code>0xDEAD_MFA_MISSING_TOKEN</code></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="debug-console">
        <span class="debug-title">[SYSTEM_DIAGNOSTIC_DUMP_v3.1]</span>
        <div class="log-entry">> Initializing environment checks...</div>
        <div class="log-entry">> WORKDIR: <span class="highlight">/app</span> [OK]</div>
        <div class="log-entry">> NODE_ENV: production</div>
        <div class="log-entry">> MOUNT_POINT: <span class="highlight">/app/public</span> (Static Assets) [RW]</div>
        <div class="log-entry">> Checking security modules...</div>
        <div class="log-entry log-success">> SUID Helper Found: <span class="highlight">/readflag</span> (Permissions: 4755)</div>
        <div class="log-entry log-warn">> WARNING: /flag file is protected (Mode: 0400). Root access required.</div>
        <div class="log-entry">> MFA_MODULE: Not Loaded.</div>
        <div class="log-entry">> SESSION_ID: <%= Math.random().toString(36).substring(7) %></div>
    </div>
    
    <a href="/admin" style="color:#666; text-decoration:none; margin-top:20px;">&lt;&lt; 返回登录接口</a>
</body>
</html>